{"ref":"BDB, אֵלוֹן²","hw":"אֵלוֹן²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>= <em>id.</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵלָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵלָה²\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵלָה</a> n.pr.<strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a son of Zebulun <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:14\" href=\"/Genesis.46.14\">Gn 46:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:26\" href=\"/Numbers.26.26\">Nu 26:26</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:34\" href=\"/Genesis.26.34\">Gn 26:34</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:2\" href=\"/Genesis.36.2\">36:2</a> a Hittite, father-in-law of Esau.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:11\" href=\"/Judges.12.11\">Ju 12:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:12\" href=\"/Judges.12.12\">12</a> a judge of Isr., of tribe of Zeb.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.loc.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:43\" href=\"/Joshua.19.43\">Jos 19:43</a> a town of Dan; so <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.9\">1 K 4:9</a> (where read <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ וּבֵית ח׳</span> Th Klo).","next":"BDB, אֵלֹנִי","prev":"BDB, אֵלוֹן"}